Material used but not included in this repository:

  Phoneme model. facebook/wav2vec2-xlsr-53-espeak-cv-ft, Apache 2.0, by Qiantong Xu,
  Alexei Baevski and Michael Auli (https://arxiv.org/abs/2109.11680). It is downloaded
  from Hugging Face on first use.

  Pronunciations. espeak-ng, GPL 3 or later, through the phonemizer-fork package (GPL 3)
  and the espeakng-loader package. They are installed by pip and only write pronunciations
  of names.

Material included in this repository:

  samples/*.wav. Speech synthesized with Kokoro (Apache 2.0), Kokoro 82M by hexgrad,
  https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M, run through kokoro-onnx
  (https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx). The sample files are licensed CC BY 4.0,
  see samples/LICENSE.
